From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Doe <john.doe@somewhere.on.planet>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] JM10 boot-from-external: enable SCSI/SATA so the mSATA disk can boot

Part of the optional JM10_BOOT_EXTERNAL mode: keep a full OS on an
external USB2 / mSATA disk and boot it from an eMMC that carries only
the bootloader. Apply together with the sibling boot-ext patches.

Signed-off-by: John Doe <john.doe@somewhere.on.planet>
---
 configs/rk3588_defconfig | 9 +
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/rk3588_defconfig b/configs/rk3588_defconfig
index b5a8234a7101..b5a8234a7101 100644
--- a/configs/rk3588_defconfig
+++ b/configs/rk3588_defconfig
@@ -234,3 +234,12 @@
 CONFIG_OPTEE_CLIENT=y
 CONFIG_OPTEE_V2=y
 CONFIG_OPTEE_ALWAYS_USE_SECURITY_PARTITION=n
+
+CONFIG_AHCI=y
+CONFIG_CMD_SCSI=y
+CONFIG_DM_SCSI=y
+CONFIG_DWC_AHCI=y
+CONFIG_LIBATA=y
+CONFIG_PHY_ROCKCHIP_NANENG_COMBOPHY=y
+CONFIG_SCSI=y
+CONFIG_SCSI_AHCI=y
-- 
